  "note": "Which ephemeral-ui card a tool call grows. Keys are MCP server names as Hermes registers them (mcp__<server>__<tool>), normalized to lowercase with '-' for '_'. `tools` is checked in order: the first regex (case-insensitive, tested against the tool name) that matches picks the card kind; a null kind means that call grows no card (admin, lookup and unrelated calls); \"\" matches anything. Rules are written against the servers' real tool names (src/components/assistant-ui/ephemeral/connectors.test.ts). build-kit.mjs checks every app and kind against the vendored kit.",
